# Course prose is hand-tuned and checked by scripts/check-*.js.
# Prettier rewrites *em* to _em_ and reflows the README tables whose
# &nbsp;/word-joiner padding check-tables.js maintains deliberately —
# so markdown is off-limits. JS and JSON still format normally.
*.md

# slides.html is BUILD OUTPUT — Marp's, regenerated by export-slides.yml on
# every slides.md push, and CLAUDE.md says never hand-edit it. Its inlined CSS
# is a single 26,000-character line; Prettier would explode that into thousands
# of lines, producing an enormous diff on a file nobody is meant to read, which
# the next workflow run then overwrites anyway.
week-*/slides.html
